         r"\ln[A]_t = -kt + \ln[A]_0 \quad (\text{or } [A]_t = [A]_0 e^{-kt})",
         "Integrating −d[A]/dt = k[A] yields exponential decay of reactant [A] over time. A reaction is confirmed to be first order if a plot of ln[A]_t versus time t is a straight line with slope = −k and y-intercept = ln[A]₀ (units of k: s⁻¹). Governs unimolecular decompositions (N₂O₅, H₂O₂) and all radioactive decay.",
         ["H2O2", "H2O", "O2"], "kinetics_spectrometer",
